        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 137,
        "headingId": 767,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Not recommended:</em> infundibuloisthmicoma; outer root sheath acanthoma; infundibular adenoma.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-24T18:28:40"
      }
    ],
